  "description": {
   "en": "Meabuki is an office worker who loves BL and has never had a boyfriend in her life.\nWhile browsing for some sexual entertainment at a comic café on Christmas Eve, Aoi, a gay man who is a total stranger to her, proposes that she move in with him on the condition that she \"listens to his sexy stories\"?!\nAoi's stories are the best, and they satisfy both her body and soul...!\n\nThey're not sex friends nor lovers, but a 100% pure “I just want to listen to your dirty stories” — the start of a gay boy and fujoshi's cohabitation life begins!"
